{
  "_about": "Character creation (docs/first-launch-story.md, 'Character creation'; js/shared/character.js). The character is drawn from layers, bottom to top; each layer is an SVG file (placeholder art) whose fill=\"currentColor\" parts take the colour of one category's choice (tint). {body} in a file name is the body choice (boy/girl). A category is a row of picture swatches: a colour (color) or, for 'body', a whole figure. 'focus' is the part of the picture a swatch and its tab show (a viewBox), so no reading is needed. A new category (hairstyle, glasses, hijab, Eid clothes) is a new entry here plus its layer files, with no code change: a category with 'variant' picks files ({<category id>} in a layer's file name) instead of a colour. Skin tones follow the Cast's rule (docs/Nani jo Ghar — Cast.md, 'Skin tones'): warm and unsaturated around Zafar's #C49A78, never orange.",
